@startuml
title State diagram for the Ott Based System Mini Reel class

[*] --> EmptyAcct : Open

state "Empty\nacct" as EmptyAcct
state "Account Created" as AccountCreated
state "Video Watching" as VideoWatching
state "Video Uploading" as VideoUploading
state "Likes List" as LikesList
state "Discussion Option" as DiscussionOption

EmptyAcct --> AccountCreated : Create Acct
AccountCreated --> EmptyAcct : Login
EmptyAcct --> VideoWatching : Open
VideoWatching --> VideoUploading : Upload Video
VideoUploading --> VideoWatching : Continue Watching
VideoWatching --> LikesList : Save to Likes
LikesList --> VideoWatching : View Saved Videos
VideoWatching --> DiscussionOption : Enter Discussion

AccountCreated --> VideoWatching : Login
DiscussionOption --> [*]

@enduml
